* LM7805_EDU - SIMPLIFIED EDUCATIONAL MODEL, NOT A VENDOR MODEL
* Pin order: IN GND OUT
* Functional behavior: output clamps near 5V when IN >= 7V,
* approximates 2V dropout, approximately 5mA quiescent at 15.3V,
* and approximate input current tracking for output load.
* No realistic thermal shutdown, output-current limit, startup loop dynamics,
* temperature effects, PSRR, or high frequency noise.
.SUBCKT LM7805_EDU IN GND OUT
BREF NREF GND V=limit(V(IN,GND)-2,0,5)
R_OUT NREF OUT 0.08
BLOAD IN GND I=limit(V(NREF,OUT)/0.08,0,10)
R_IQ IN GND 3060
RLEAK OUT GND 100Meg
.ENDS LM7805_EDU
